Source: qemu-system-generator
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Daniel Gomez <da.gomez@kernel.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc (>= 1.85), scdoc
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/linux-kdevops/qemu-system-generator
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: qemu-system-generator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, socat, systemd
Recommends: qemu-system, virtiofsd
Description: systemd generator that turns .qemu files into QEMU services
 Reads .qemu files, systemd unit-file syntax with a [QEMU] section that
 passes QEMU's command line through, and generates the service, socket
 and virtiofsd units that run the machine under systemd.
